SUMMARY:Fewer Prompts\, More Focus (AI Hacks & Hops)
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**Fewer Prompts\, More Focus**\nAI tools w
 ere designed to give us time back. Yet\, many of us now spend our days bab
 ysitting them. Back-and-forth prompting\, copy and pasting\, and constantl
 y switching tabs are pulling our attention away from the work that matters
  most. Join us to explore how proactive AI workflows can free up your time
  and energy to lock in on your customers\, your ideas\, and the problems t
 hat only you can solve.\n\n**Speaker: [Will Anderson](https://www.linkedin
 .com/in/will-anderson10/)**\nWill Anderson is an optimist\, creative\, and
  problem solver who helps people understand and navigate the human consequ
 ences of technologies like AI. He currently works remotely as an AI Operat
 ions Enginner for [Workshop](https://useworkshop.com)\, where he leads AI 
 enablement and builds internal tooling to allow all of his colleagues to d
 o their best work. As a new Asheville resident\, he's really excited to ju
 mp into the digital nomads community and share some of the things he's lea
 rned by using these tools every day for the last few years.\n\n**Event Age
 nda**\n5:30 PM – 6:00 PM: Networking\, Drinks & Setup\n6:00 PM – 7:30 
 PM: presentation\n\n**Special discount on ADN engraved Pirani cups!**\nGet
  $10 off our 5th anniversary customized [ADN Pirani cups](https://avldigit
 alnomads.org/meet-our-brand-new-customized-adn-pirani-mugs/)! Available in
  16oz\, 26oz\, and 32oz sizes\, you can select yours directly at this even
 t.\n\n**General Event Info**\nAI Hacks and Hops is a monthly event tailore
 d for non-technical professionals\, entrepreneurs\, marketers\, engineers\
 , or anyone who wants to explore and discuss how to use AI.\n\nEach gather
 ing will feature presentations\, stimulating group discussions\, and a rel
 axed atmosphere for enjoying your favorite brews while delving into the wo
 rld of AI. Topics will range from AI integration in business processes\, m
 arketing\, content creation\, software\, ethical considerations\, human-AI
  collaboration strategies\, to the latest advancements in AI technology. T
 he informal setting encourages open dialogue\, idea exchange\, and fosters
  a collaborative spirit.
