SUMMARY:AVL UX: Portfolio Review
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n# AVL UX Event 3: Portfolio Review & Netwo
 rking Night\n\n**Show your work. Share your process. Get better together!*
 *\n\n**Portfolio Review signups open!**\n\n**Please complete our Portfolio
  Review Signup Form:** https://tally.so/r/EqqR94\n\nThis helps us understa
 nd what feedback you're looking for and organize the 15-minute review sess
 ions.\n\n**Attending just to network or observe? No additional form needed
 !**\n\nJoin Asheville's UX and product community for an evening focused on
  **portfolio feedback\, professional development\, and networking.**\n\n##
  **Portfolio Review**\n\nBring your portfolio\, case study\, or work in pr
 ogress on your laptop\, tablet\, or phone.\n\nExperienced professionals fr
 om UX\, design\, research\, and product will be available to provide feedb
 ack on:\n\n* Portfolio storytelling and case studies\n* UX process and des
 ign decisions\n* Visual presentation and structure\n* Problem framing and 
 communication\n\nReviewers will circulate throughout the event\, offering 
 individual feedback and opportunities for discussion. Attendees can also e
 xchange ideas\, share their work\, and learn from one another.\n\n### **Po
 rtfolio Reviewers**\n\n**Reviewer lineup coming soon!**\n\n## **What to Ex
 pect**\n\n* Portfolio reviews with experienced professionals.\n* Peer-to-p
 eer feedback and knowledge sharing.\n* Professional networking with Ashevi
 lle's design and product community.\n\n## **Who's Welcome?**\n\n**Everyone
 !**\nDesigners\, researchers\, product managers\, developers\, founders\, 
 students\, career-switchers\, and anyone interested in UX and product desi
 gn.\n**No portfolio? No problem!** Join us to learn from others\, exchange
  ideas\, and build connections within Asheville's growing UX community.\n\
 n## **Event Details**\n\n**Date:** Thursday\, November 12\, 2026\n**Time:*
 * 6:00–8:00 PM\n**Venue:** 7 Acres Coworking\n**Address:** 105 Fairview 
 Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28803\n**Cost:** Free\n**Hosted by:** AVL UX + Ashevil
 le Digital Nomads\n**Sponsored by:** Aktiga\n**See you there! 👋**
