SUMMARY:TGIF Lunch Break at Taco Boy
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nJoin us for a TGIF lunch break - Mexican s
 tyle. This time\, we are trying out Taco Boy\, South Asheville\, “A Taqu
 eria for The Soul”. The bar offers an extensive list of hand-crafted mar
 garitas\, cocktails\, wines\, and local craft beers... They run lunch as c
 ounter service.\nThe event runs for 1.5 hours for those coming a bit late 
 or needing to leave quickly.\n\nTaco Boy is located in Biltmore Park\, Ard
 en.\n\nWe plan to sit inside and enjoy conversation and Mexican food - a c
 ocktail if your weekend starts early!\n\nHere is the [full menu here](http
 s://tupelohoneycafe.com/south-asheville/menu/brunch-menu)\, vegetarian opt
 ions are available.\nMake sure to look for our ADN table sign!\n\nAs this 
 is a capped lunch social\, if you find you can't attend after registering 
 please cancel so those on the wait list may join.\n\nLooking forward to se
 eing you!
