SUMMARY:The Leadership Lounge: The Three Pillars
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nYou want to do your best work every time. 
 It's important to you\, and you care about how you show up and what your t
 eam thinks of you.\nBeing present for ourselves is a significant challenge
  that often creates a gap. This gap represents the difference between the 
 way we aspire to live and how we actually live. We choose to bridge this g
 ap because it is the right thing to do.\n\nIntroducing a great way for new
  nomads to connect and discover important key takeaways for their lives. A
 s a new Asheville Digital Nomad\, where do you go if you don’t know many
  people?\n\nYou will participate in a discussion\, yes! YOU\, the audience
 \, will be a part of a wonderful panel discussion. Whether you are a veter
 an or a newbie\, come to **The Leadership Lounge**. You will get something
  out of this event and gain new insights to improve your outlook on how we
 ll you are settling into Asheville and Western North Carolina.\n\n**The Le
 adership Lounge** presents a fabulous evening: **The Three Pillars.** This
  special occasion will introduce you to new actions to manage burnout and 
 physiological changes\, combining practicality with an intuitive desire fo
 r more fun.\n**Pillar I - Somatic Sovereignty**: Lindsay Coward\n**Pillar 
 II - Self-Leadership**: Stacy Antos\n**Pillar III - The Sovereign Career**
 : Jane Carter\n\n***Special discount* on 'ADN'-engraved Pirani cups! 5th-a
 nniversary custom ADN Pirani cups!**\n**Available in 16 oz\, 26 oz\, and 3
 2 oz for $15\, $20\, and $25.**\n\nEveryone! Whether you're leading in for
 -profit\, non-profit\, academia\, community organizations\, or entrepreneu
 rship – or simply curious about leadership – you're welcome to join us
 .\n\n* Free Parking\n* Beverages: Alcoholic and non-alcoholic beverages\n\
 nCome join us. Meet new people. Take away some next steps.
