SUMMARY:🍂 AVL Digital Nomads: Epic Friendsgiving Feast! 🦃
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\n**🌟 Fifth Annual Potluck Extravaganza 
 🌟**\n\nCalling all remote and independent workers! Get ready for the mo
 st anticipated event of the year - our Fifth Annual Friendsgiving Potluck 
 Party!\n\nWe have some surprises in store for the evening to make this eve
 nt even more special and memorable.\n\n**🎉 Why You Can't Miss This:**\n
 \n* **Connect with Your Tribe**: Whether you're a seasoned nomad or new to
  remote life\, this is your chance to mingle with like-minded adventurers!
 \n* **Feast Like Royalty**: Prepare your taste buds for an explosion of fl
 avors! From mouthwatering mains to delectable desserts\, our potluck sprea
 d is legendary.\n* **Cozy Vibes\, Cool People**: Embrace the warmth of the
  season in the company of the coolest remote workers in Asheville.\n* **Pi
 e Becomes an Icebreaker!** This year we’re adding a new twist. We’d li
 ke everyone to share their dessert time with someone they don't know yet. 
 Let’s be sure to welcome all our new nomads and outside guests.\n* **Sip
  and Celebrate:** Raise a glass\, the bar is open at The Mule at Devil's F
 oot Beverage Company\, where you’ll find an enticing selection of house-
 made non-alcoholic beverages & beer and hand-mixed cocktails. The Mule has
  been an incredible supporter and partner for our nomad community. Cheers!
  🍻🥂\n* **Introvert-Friendly\, Extrovert-Approved**: Our welcoming at
 mosphere ensures everyone feels right at home. No awkward small talk requi
 red!\n\n**🍽️ The Lowdown:**\n**Where**: The Mule at Devil's Foot Beve
 rage Company (Plenty of parking\, easy to find!)\n**What to Bring**: Your 
 favorite dish to share (appetizer\, main\, side\, or dessert) + your aweso
 me self!\n**Bonus Points**: Label your dish and list ingredients for our d
 iet-conscious friends\n\n**🚀 Let's Break a Record!**\nJoin the fun in t
 he comments below - share what delicious dish you're bringing. Let's set a
  Meetup comment thread record and get our taste buds tingling!\n\nWe are a
 lso looking to **collect nonperishable items to donate** to various pantri
 es around Asheville. Show your gratitude during this holiday season. Pleas
 e bring canned goods\, pasta\, rice\, or other unopened nonperishable food
  items to contribute upon entry. (Please\, no glass!)\n\nWe will be donati
 ng to www.bountifulcities.org\n\nList of items to donate:\n\nhttps://drive
 .google.com/file/d/1xSI0FEJdGwmbxjn9D96Qxl84ssvyGKXJ/view?usp=drive_link\n
 \n**🌈 Remember:**\nAll are welcome - newbies\, regulars\, and everyone 
 in between!\nPlates\, cups\, napkins\, and utensils provided (we've got yo
 u covered!)\nBring a friend\, make a friend - double the fun!\n\nDon't mis
 s out on this epic gathering of AVL's finest digital nomads. It's more tha
 n just a meal\; it's a celebration of connection\, generosity\, and the in
 credible community we've built together.\n\nSee you there\, legends! 🎊
